      {
        "n": "HIGH NOON: MEN IN THE CITIES W/ DINA J (R)",
        "s": "2026-11-08T00:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-08T02:00:00Z",
        "d": "Dina Juntila aka Dina J is a Los Angeles based DJ. record collector and music supervisor. \"High Noon\" is a seated round about of sounds with the idea that the mix is its own OST for some unknown film. Each month features a special guest with a similar sickness.\nFrom the host: \"This mix is inspired by Robert Longo's \"Men in the Cities\" \nThe palette is high-contrast black and white, punctured by sharp metallic hits and sudden bursts of motion. It feels like time freezing at the exact instant control is lost: corporate polish unraveling into raw, electric chaos.\"",
        "j": "DINA J",
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/dina-j/episodes/dina-j-1st-may-2026",
